---
source: crates/pixiu-accounts/src/mail/templates.rs
expression: "[test(\"a@example.com\"), verify_email(\"a@example.com\", \"alice\", link),\npassword_reset(\"a@example.com\", \"alice\", link),\nnew_registration(\"admin@example.com\", \"bob\", \"bob@example.com\", link),\nregistration_approved(\"b@example.com\", \"bob\", link),\nregistration_declined(\"b@example.com\", \"bob\"),\nemail_in_use(\"a@example.com\", link),\nyoutube_music_expired(\"a@example.com\", \"alice\", \"signed out\", link),\nwatch_failing(\"a@example.com\", \"alice\", \"Liked music\", \"timeout\",\nlink),].iter().map(|email|\nformat!(\"To: {}\\nSubject: {}\\n\\n{}\", email.to, email.subject,\nemail.text)).collect::<Vec<_>>().join(\"\\n---\\n\")"
---
To: a@example.com
Subject: píxiū can send email

This is a test from píxiū: the mail server works.

---
To: a@example.com
Subject: Confirm your email address for píxiū

Hi alice,

Confirm this is your email address, so píxiū can send you password resets and alerts. The link works for 7 days.

Confirm my email: https://music.example.com/somewhere

---
To: a@example.com
Subject: Reset your píxiū password

Hi alice,

Someone asked to reset the password of your píxiū account. If it was you, choose a new one; the link works for an hour. If not, ignore this email: nothing changes.

Choose a new password: https://music.example.com/somewhere

---
To: admin@example.com
Subject: bob asks for a píxiū account

bob (bob@example.com) registered on píxiū.

Approve them, and they get an email to confirm their address; deny them, and they get a short note.

Review the request: https://music.example.com/somewhere

---
To: b@example.com
Subject: Your píxiū account is approved

Hi bob,

An admin approved your píxiū account. Confirm your email address, and you can sign in. The link works for 7 days.

Confirm my email: https://music.example.com/somewhere

---
To: b@example.com
Subject: Your píxiū registration

Hi bob,

An admin declined your request for a píxiū account, so none was made.

---
To: a@example.com
Subject: Someone registered on píxiū with your email

Someone asked for a píxiū account with this email address, which already has one. If it was you, sign in, or reset your password if you forgot it. If not, ignore this email.

Sign in: https://music.example.com/somewhere

---
To: a@example.com
Subject: Sign in to YouTube Music again on píxiū

Hi alice,

YouTube Music no longer accepts píxiū's sign-in to your account, so your liked music and private playlists stop syncing. Sign in again to carry on.

YouTube Music said: signed out

Sign in again: https://music.example.com/somewhere

---
To: a@example.com
Subject: píxiū cannot sync “Liked music”

Hi alice,

Syncing your watch “Liked music” failed several times in a row.

The last error: timeout

See your watches: https://music.example.com/somewhere
